WEBVTT

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.960
We are looking for technology partners,

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:07.800
dental software vendors and
industry partners

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:12.960
across Europe, and for chains and insurers
ready to start in their own country.

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:16.840
Our country pages explain what we are
looking for in each market.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:21.200
Your own use case funds the connector,
and countries share the costs.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:24.940
Between two thousand twenty-seven and two
thousand twenty-nine we will

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:29.640
connect the first practices; in two thousand
twenty-nine, a catalogued dental

00:00:29.690 --> 00:00:35.120
data space ready for the European Health
Data Space; then, dental imaging.

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:37.440
We also want to talk to the
dental industry,

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:41.340
EU projects, research and
professional associations.

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.440
Shall we talk?

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:46.310
Write to partners at
softwareinabox dot eu.
